---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Website Disclaimer"
description: "KD Holidayz website disclaimer — accuracy of website information, third-party links and limitation of liability."
---
{% import "partials/page-banner.njk" as banner with context %}
{% import "partials/icons.njk" as icon %}
{% set india = company.offices[0] %}
{% set kenya = company.offices[1] %}

{{ banner.render([{"label":"Home","url":"/"},{"label":"Website Disclaimer"}], "🌐 Website Terms", "Website Disclaimer", null, "website-disclaimer") }}

<section class="privacy-v2">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="legal-meta text-muted">
      <span class="pill">Effective Date: 22 September 2026</span>
      <span class="pill">Last Updated: 22 September 2026</span>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-v2__layout">
      <aside class="privacy-v2__sidebar">
        <div class="card privacy-v2__sidebar-card">
          <div class="privacy-v2__progress" aria-hidden="true"><div class="privacy-v2__progress-bar" id="pvProgressBar"></div></div>
          <div class="privacy-v2__meta text-muted">📖 23 sections · ~6 min read</div>
          <nav class="privacy-v2__nav" id="pvNav" aria-label="Website disclaimer categories">
            <a href="#cat-about" data-cat="cat-about"><span class="privacy-v2__nav-icon">{{ icon.render("tag", 16) }}</span>About This Website</a>
            <a href="#cat-content" data-cat="cat-content"><span class="privacy-v2__nav-icon">{{ icon.render("globe", 16) }}</span>Travel Content Accuracy</a>
            <a href="#cat-suppliers" data-cat="cat-suppliers"><span class="privacy-v2__nav-icon">{{ icon.render("compass", 16) }}</span>Suppliers &amp; Links</a>
            <a href="#cat-security" data-cat="cat-security"><span class="privacy-v2__nav-icon">{{ icon.render("shield", 16) }}</span>Site Operation &amp; Security</a>
            <a href="#cat-use" data-cat="cat-use"><span class="privacy-v2__nav-icon">{{ icon.render("person", 16) }}</span>Your Use of the Site</a>
            <a href="#cat-legal" data-cat="cat-legal"><span class="privacy-v2__nav-icon">{{ icon.render("mail", 16) }}</span>Legal &amp; Contact</a>
          </nav>
          <div class="privacy-v2__actions">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost btn--sm" id="pvExpandAll">Expand All</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost btn--sm" id="pvCollapseAll">Collapse All</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>

      <div class="privacy-v2__main">
        <section class="privacy-v2__category" id="cat-about">
          <div class="privacy-v2__category-head">
            <span class="privacy-v2__category-icon">{{ icon.render("tag", 20) }}</span>
            <h2>About This Website</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="accordion accordion--legal">
            <div class="accordion__item is-open">
              <button class="accordion__trigger" type="button" aria-expanded="true">
                <span class="accordion__badge"><span class="accordion__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>
                <span class="accordion__question">1. General Information</span>
              </button>
              <div class="accordion__panel"><div class="accordion__panel-inner">
                <p>The information provided on www.kdholidayz.in is intended for general travel information, marketing and customer assistance purposes. KD Holidayz is a registered proprietorship based in Jamnagar, Gujarat, India, providing domestic and international travel services.</p>
              </div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion__item">
              <button class="accordion__trigger" type="button" aria-expanded="false">
                <span class="accordion__badge"><span class="accordion__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>
                <span class="accordion__question">2. Accuracy of Website Information</span>
              </button>
              <div class="accordion__panel"><div class="accordion__panel-inner">
                <p>KD Holidayz makes reasonable efforts to keep website content accurate and current. However, prices, availability, schedules, hotel facilities, itineraries, visa requirements, destination information and other details may change without prior notice. Website information should not be treated as a guarantee of availability or final booking terms.</p>
              </div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion__item">
              <button class="accordion__trigger" type="button" aria-expanded="false">
                <span class="accordion__badge"><span class="accordion__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>
                <span class="accordion__question">3. Prices and Offers</span>
              </button>
              <div class="accordion__panel"><div class="accordion__panel-inner">
                <p>Prices and promotional offers displayed on the website may be subject to availability, travel dates, taxes, currency fluctuations, supplier changes, booking conditions and other restrictions. The final price will be confirmed in the applicable quotation, invoice or booking confirmation.</p>
              </div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion__item">
              <button class="accordion__trigger" type="button" aria-expanded="false">
                <span class="accordion__badge"><span class="accordion__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>
                <span class="accordion__question">4. Availability</span>
              </button>
              <div class="accordion__panel"><div class="accordion__panel-inner">
                <p>Displaying a travel package, hotel, flight or service on the website does not guarantee availability. Availability may change at any time and is confirmed only when the relevant booking has been accepted and confirmed.</p>
              </div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-v2__category" id="cat-content">
          <div class="privacy-v2__category-head">
            <span class="privacy-v2__category-icon">{{ icon.render("globe", 20) }}</span>
            <h2>Travel Content Accuracy</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="accordion accordion--legal">
            <div class="accordion__item">
              <button class="accordion__trigger" type="button" aria-expanded="false">
                <span class="accordion__badge"><span class="accordion__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>
                <span class="accordion__question">5. Travel Packages and Itineraries</span>
              </button>
              <div class="accordion__panel"><div class="accordion__panel-inner">
                <p>Itineraries shown on the website are indicative unless expressly identified as a confirmed itinerary. Actual arrangements may change due to supplier availability, weather, local conditions, operational requirements, government restrictions or other circumstances.</p>
              </div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion__item">
              <button class="accordion__trigger" type="button" aria-expanded="false">
                <span class="accordion__badge"><span class="accordion__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>
                <span class="accordion__question">6. Flights and Airline Information</span>
              </button>
              <div class="accordion__panel"><div class="accordion__panel-inner">
                <p>Flight schedules, fares, baggage rules, routes, aircraft, seat availability and other airline information may change. The relevant airline's confirmed ticket and fare rules apply to the customer's booking.</p>
              </div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion__item">
              <button class="accordion__trigger" type="button" aria-expanded="false">
                <span class="accordion__badge"><span class="accordion__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>
                <span class="accordion__question">7. Hotels and Resorts</span>
              </button>
              <div class="accordion__panel"><div class="accordion__panel-inner">
                <p>Hotel names, room categories, photographs, facilities, meal plans, star ratings and descriptions are provided for informational or promotional purposes. Facilities and services may change. The confirmed booking documents and property terms apply to the customer's reservation.</p>
              </div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion__item">
              <button class="accordion__trigger" type="button" aria-expanded="false">
                <span class="accordion__badge"><span class="accordion__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>
                <span class="accordion__question">8. Visa and Immigration Information</span>
              </button>
              <div class="accordion__panel"><div class="accordion__panel-inner">
                <p>Visa and immigration information published on the website is general information and may change. Visa decisions are made by the relevant government or immigration authority. Customers should review current requirements before travel. KD Holidayz does not guarantee visa approval, processing time or entry into a destination.</p>
              </div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion__item">
              <button class="accordion__trigger" type="button" aria-expanded="false">
                <span class="accordion__badge"><span class="accordion__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>
                <span class="accordion__question">9. Travel Advisories and Health Requirements</span>
              </button>
              <div class="accordion__panel"><div class="accordion__panel-inner">
                <p>Travel advisories, health requirements, vaccination rules, entry restrictions and other government requirements may change. Customers are responsible for checking applicable requirements and obtaining appropriate travel, medical or other professional advice.</p>
              </div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-v2__category" id="cat-suppliers">
          <div class="privacy-v2__category-head">
            <span class="privacy-v2__category-icon">{{ icon.render("compass", 20) }}</span>
            <h2>Suppliers &amp; Links</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="accordion accordion--legal">
            <div class="accordion__item">
              <button class="accordion__trigger" type="button" aria-expanded="false">
                <span class="accordion__badge"><span class="accordion__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>
                <span class="accordion__question">10. Third-Party Suppliers</span>
              </button>
              <div class="accordion__panel"><div class="accordion__panel-inner">
                <p>KD Holidayz works with independent airlines, hotels, DMCs, transport providers, tour operators, insurers, visa service providers and other suppliers. Their services are subject to their own terms and conditions. KD Holidayz cannot guarantee the performance of an independent supplier, subject to applicable law.</p>
              </div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion__item">
              <button class="accordion__trigger" type="button" aria-expanded="false">
                <span class="accordion__badge"><span class="accordion__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></span>
                <span class="accordion__question">11. External Links</span>
              </button>
              <div class="accordion__panel"><div class="accordion__panel-inner">
                <p>The website may contain links to third-party websites. These links are provided for convenience or reference. KD Holidayz does not control or endorse third-party content, availability, security, privacy practices or accuracy.</p>
              </div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-v2__category" id="cat-security">
          <div class="privacy-v2__category-head">
            <span class="privacy-v2__category-icon">{{ icon.render("shield", 20) }}</span>
            <h2>Site Operation &amp; Security</h2>
          </div>
